# Short links for places where the address is shown as text (a bio, a page's
# About section, a QR code) or has to be read out to someone over the phone (a
# directory set up by its own staff). Each forwards to the home page with its UTM tags,
# so the visit is still attributed (lib/attribution.mjs reads them on landing)
# while people only ever see jpdcompleteelectrical.com.au/ig.
#
# 302, not 301: a browser keeps a 301 forever, so a short link pointed at the
# wrong place could never be corrected for anyone who'd already used it.
#
# Each path is listed with and without its trailing slash, because the site is
# exported with trailing slashes and a link can be typed either way.
#
# The full tagged addresses are the register in the admin repo
# (thermal-report/lib/marketing-links.js); test/short-links.test.mjs checks
# every line here.

/ig     /?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile   302
/ig/    /?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile   302
/fb     /?utm_source=facebook&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile    302
/fb/    /?utm_source=facebook&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile    302
/li     /?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile    302
/li/    /?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=profile    302
/qr     /?utm_source=business-card&utm_medium=print&utm_campaign=qr     302
/qr/    /?utm_source=business-card&utm_medium=print&utm_campaign=qr     302
/van    /?utm_source=van&utm_medium=print&utm_campaign=qr               302
/van/   /?utm_source=van&utm_medium=print&utm_campaign=qr               302
/yp     /?utm_source=yellowpages&utm_medium=directory&utm_campaign=listing  302
/yp/    /?utm_source=yellowpages&utm_medium=directory&utm_campaign=listing  302
